<title>SWEDEN: Atlas Copco bids for Prime Service.</title>
<headline>Atlas Copco bids for Prime Service.</headline>
<dateline>STOCKHOLM 1997-06-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Swedish industrial engineer Atlas Copco said on Monday it was bidding seven billion crowns, or $900 million, for U.S. machinery leasing group Prime Service Inc.</p>
<p>Atlas Copco said in a statement that its bid of $32 a share had been approved by Prime Service's board.</p>
